<title>POLAND: GORAZDZE SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 7.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>GORAZDZE SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 7.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.52 vs   8.58</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.53 vs   8.58</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.28 vs   7.03</p>
<p> Sales		   24.18 vs  22.81</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    45.88 vs  54.52</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	45.96 vs  55.05</p>
<p> Operating profit    31.40 vs  46.17</p>
<p> Sales		  169.45 vs 172.70</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cement maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Cementow-Wapiennicze Gorazdze SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
